r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Role-aware views</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Managers see the whole branch; employees see exactly what they own and what comes next.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-6 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Bank-grade security</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Built on secure, audited cloud infrastructure designed for regulated financial teams.</p></li></ul></div></section><section id="workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-heading" class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 md:py-32"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center"><p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">How it works</p><h2 id="workflow-heading" class="mt-4 text-balance font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-5xl">From assignment to insight in <span class="text-gradient-brand">four steps.</span></h2></div><ol class="mt-16 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="flex flex-col bg-background p-8"><span class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold text-gradient-brand">01</span><h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Assign</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The branch manager creates a task, picks an owner, sets the deadline and priority, and